# Project Structure

- `apps/mobile` — SwiftUI iOS client
- `apps/api` — NestJS server (in-memory store + cache, no DB)
- `packages/programs` — program seed JSON (source of truth)

Keep API and mobile models aligned. Prefer shared seed JSON over hardcoding workouts in Swift.

No comments unless a short doc comment clarifies a non-obvious function.